Copyright 2024 Marigold authors, PRS ETH Zurich, and Copyright 2024 The HuggingFace Team,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications
-------------
These files were modified by the WonderWorld and WonderZoom authors; they came to WonderZoom
through WonderWorld (https://github.com/KovenYu/WonderWorld). They differ from the upstream
Marigold releases. The main changes:

- marigold_pipeline.py: the depth pipeline (MarigoldPipeline) was adapted for use inside
  WonderWorld/WonderZoom, and l1_loss / l2_loss helpers were added. The normals pipelines
  (MarigoldPipelineNormal, MarigoldNormalsPipeline) and their helpers (normalize_normals,
  ensemble_normals, MarigoldNormalsOutput) were added, adapted from diffusers'
  pipeline_marigold_normals.py.
- marigold_process.py: MarigoldImageProcessor, adapted from diffusers'
  marigold_image_processing.py.
- __init__.py and util/: adjusted to the changes above.

WonderZoom loads the Marigold normals weights (prs-eth/marigold-normals-v0-1, Apache-2.0) from
Hugging Face; no weights are stored here. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md at the repository root.
